ODW8110 [*] Missing `return` (`super` is used) in method write
 --> missing_return.py:4:9
  |
2 |     _inherit = "my.model"
3 |
4 |     def write(self, vals):
  |         ^^^^^
5 |         super().write(vals)
  |
help: Return the `super()` call
  |
4 |     def write(self, vals):
  -         super().write(vals)
5 +         return super().write(vals)
6 |
  |
note: This is an unsafe fix and may change runtime behavior

