ODW8110 Missing `return` (`super` is used) in method name_get
  --> missing_return.py:36:9
   |
34 |     # The name is only bound in one branch, so a `return res` at the end of the method could
35 |     # find nothing to return.
36 |     def name_get(self):
   |         ^^^^^^^^
37 |         if self.env.context.get("short"):
38 |             res = super().name_get()
   |
help: Return the `super()` call

ODW8110 Missing `return` (`super` is used) in method fields_view_get
  --> missing_return.py:41:9
